    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Andrew Deftereos of Leonard Wilson Keenan is delighted to present to the market 65 Myrtle Road.\r\n \r\n\r\nThis South-facing three-bedroom, penthouse apartment situated in the sought after Coast Complex in Baldoyle is presented in good condition throughout.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGenerously proportioned and filled with natural light, this home offers a modern layout complemented by far-reaching views across the surrounding landscape. The spacious and light-filled accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, 3 bedrooms (2 en suite doubles & 1 single), a family bathroom and a large bright living area with balcony and modern kitchen and open plan dining lounge area.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is fitted with double glazed windows, a security intercom system and has a private communal garden for residents and access to a sunny rooftop terrace with incredible views of Howth and the Dublin Mountains. It will appeal to first time buyers, investors (no rental cap) or someone looking to downsize. There is a designated on street parking space.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe location is excellent with all local shopping amenities Lidl and Donaghmede shopping center in close proximity and easy access to the coastal walk to Sutton. Excellent public transport including bus & DART services nearby ensuring fast access to the City Centre. There is also easy access to the M50 Motorway, the M1 and Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEarly viewing of this wonderful property is highly recommended\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
